"description":"Included Health is a healthcare benefit provided by employers to help members track healthcare spending, find a high-quality doctor, get 24/7 health advice, and more. We’re not an insurance company, but a team of healthcare experts available over the phone, in the app, or online.\n\nWhy use Included Health?\n\nIt’s free to activate. – You don’t have to pay a cent to access your benefits because your employer has already footed the bill. \n\nPrimary, urgent and mental health care – See a board-certified doctor, licensed psychiatrist, or therapist in person or virtually with best-in-class care available 24/7.\n\nUnbiased insurance and claims support – For billing issues, we work directly with your insurance to resolve problems for you.\n\nExperts opinions from leading specialists – With access to 4,000 of the nation’s leading specialists, get the best doctor in the country to review your current care.\n\nExperts available around-the-clock – With an on-call care team answering any healthcare questions, you get treated the way you deserve without having to wait on hold for answers.\n\nWelcoming care for every community – We ensure every member from every community has access to high-quality care that’s safe, welcoming, and inclusive.\n\nHow It Works:\n\nDownload the app.\nEnter your employer information.\nGet access to amazing benefits offered at no cost to you.\n\nCommon healthcare needs Included Health supports\n- Insurance and benefits questions\n- Access to in-network, high-quality care\n- Expert second opinions from leading specialists\n- Support for chronic conditions\n- Advocating for the healthcare needs of Black and LGBTQ+ patients\n- Deductible, healthcare spending, and claims tracking\n- Mental health support\n- Prescription refills & lab orders via virtual care\n\nFrequently Asked Questions\nWho has access to Included Health?\nIncluded Health is available to members and their covered dependents enrolled in an employer-sponsored benefits plan that includes coverage of Included Health. Top employers, including one third of the Fortune 100, provide this service so that employees have access to the best medical care possible. \n\nWhen is Included Health available to help?\nWhile availability depends on your specific package, for millions of members, our team is available 24/7, 365 days a year, including weekends and holidays. \n\nWho are the doctors and specialists Included Health offers access to?\nIncluded Health contracts with experts based on many indicators of quality, including their education and training, patient outcomes, and institutional affiliation. As a result, we’re able to match you with highly experienced doctors and specialists who are best suited to your personal preferences and medical needs. \n\nWhat can your virtual care providers treat? \nOur urgent care doctors can treat hundreds of issues, including cold and flu, urinary tract infections, allergies, headache, sprains, and skin conditions. They can also order labs and screenings to help with preventative care and help manage chronic care conditions. \n\nIs Included Health my insurance?\nWe’re not your insurance. We’re a health benefit offered by employers that works directly with your insurance on your behalf. So, instead of having to resolve claims issues on your own, we do the hard work for you. We have built extensive experience working with major insurance companies and can get claims processed and questions answered accurately.\n\n*Not all benefits described above are available to all Included Health members. Services vary depending on your employer benefits package. \n\nYour Privacy is Our Priority\nWe adhere to strict HIPAA guidelines to protect your health data and personal information.\n\nOur providers are unable to prescribe controlled substances. \n\nGet Started Today\nJoin millions of members who use Included Health to get healthcare designed to treat you better. Download the app now to activate for free!", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.93217000000000016513013179064728319644927978515625, "sellerUrl":"https://www.includedhealth.com", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"312448000", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":36356, "trackContentRating":"17+", "artistId":907304336, "artistName":"Included Health, Inc.", "userRatingCount":36356}, 
